  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div id=\"isPasted\"><p data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"557\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"434\">H2o is the world’s first wine-infused sparkling refreshment with 0.0% alcohol.</strong> Crafted in Sonoma, each can delivers the crisp Sauvignon Blanc or the elegance of Pinot Noir — with the pure hydration of water.</p><p data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"825\">We’re not just another NA drink — we’re the only alcohol-free refreshment backed by university (Cal Poly) clinical research. <strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"823\">With Shopify powering tracked sales and prompt commission payments, affiliates enjoy full transparency, reliable payouts, and trusted credibility.</strong></p><p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"985\">Available in Sauvignon Blanc, Sparkling Rosé, Sparkling Moscato, Pinot Noir, and Chardonnay — all low calorie, no added sugar, and absolutely hangover-free.</p><p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1069\">Oh — and yes, it tastes ridiculously good. The health benefits are just a bonus.</p><hr data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1074\"><h3 data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1107\">• What makes us different</h3><ul data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1513\"><li data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1205\"><p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1205\">Not dealcoholized wine — it’s a new refreshment category: the amazing Sauvignon Blanc taste first, with health benefits as a bonus.</p></li><li data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1345\"><p data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1345\">Backed by science: validated in collaboration with Cal Poly University through a clinical study confirming superior hydration benefits.</p></li><li data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1434\"><p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1434\">Functional refreshment designed for wellness, heart health, and alcohol-free living.</p></li><li data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1513\"><p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1513\">First alcohol-free winery experience in California — open daily in Sonoma.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1518\"><h3 data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1547\">• How affiliates earn</h3><ul data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"2033\"><li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1637\"><p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1637\">Commission tiers: 5% (Bronze), 7% (Silver), 10%+ (Gold with loyalty bonus up to 15%).</p></li><li data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1690\"><p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1690\">Starter Reward: $50 bonus on your first 3 sales.</p></li><li data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1784\"><p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1784\">Momentum Upgrades: Long-term loyalty unlocks higher commissions even if your volume dips.</p></li><li data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1895\"><p data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1895\">Gold affiliates also enjoy free quarterly product, early access to new flavors, and spotlight recognition.</p></li><li data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"2033\"><p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2033\"><strong data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2031\">All commissions are processed automatically through Shopify — every sale tracked, every payout prompt, every affiliate protected.</strong></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2038\"><h3 data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2062\">• How to promote</h3><ul data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2462\"><li data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2151\"><p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2151\">Share your unique affiliate link on Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, YouTube, and blogs.</p></li><li data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2265\"><p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2265\">Highlight key hooks: <em data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2203\">“Wine taste, 0.0% alcohol”</em>, <em data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2227\">“Hydration + flavor”</em>, <em data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2262\">“Raise a glass, not a hangover”</em>.</p></li><li data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2375\"><p data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2375\">Showcase lifestyle angles: yoga, brunch, beach, sober curiosity, wellness routines, and family occasions.</p></li><li data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2462\"><p data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2462\">Use our provided images, banners, and copy — or create your own authentic content.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2467\"><h3 data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2494\">• Other information</h3><ul data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2917\"><li data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2607\"><p data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2607\">Customers can also shop directly by \"Text &amp; AI\" via <strong data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2573\">405.BUY.ZERO (405.289.9376)</strong>. Text <em data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2589\">INSIDER</em> to get started.</p></li><li data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2717\"><p data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2717\">Majority of repeat buyers are women who loved wine but no longer drink alcohol — strong, loyal community.</p></li><li data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2795\"><p data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2795\">We’re mission-driven: accelerating the transition to alcohol-free living.</p></li><li data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2917\"><p data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2917\">Affiliates aren’t just earning commissions — you’re part of a cause reshaping how people enjoy wellness refreshments.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
